@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-009 — Backup, restore trial, CI/CD and checkpoint
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-033, UC-034, UC-035, UC-036, UC-037

actor "Authorized operator" as Op
actor Duy
participant "CI / release runner" as CI
participant "Hosted services" as Services
database "Three owned DBs" as DB
participant "Media / package artifacts" as Assets
Op -> Services: Maintenance, stop writers and workers
Services --> Op: Quiescent state confirmed / failure
Op -> DB: Dump approved namespaces
Op -> Assets: Copy referenced originals and immutable datasets
Op -> Op: Verify manifest, hashes, encryption and completeness
alt Backup complete
 Op -> Services: Resume operation
else Incomplete
 Op -> Duy: Report failed backup; do not mark gate passed
end
Op -> DB: Restore trial into isolated local target
Op -> Op: No Production egress; check indexes, references, stale leases
CI -> CI: PR checks/build/tests; trusted main release after phase gates
alt Checks pass and release conditions authorized
 CI -> Services: Deploy affected components at known SHA
 Services --> CI: Deployment states
 CI -> Services: Smoke checks; stop dependent rollout on failure
else Checks fail
 CI -> Duy: No release; report blocker
end
Op -> Op: Update local worker from CI-checked package runbook
Duy -> Services: Check runnable MVP and critical flows
Duy -> Duy: Accept only with evidence; no Critical/Blocker

@enduml
